			"date": "2023-08-31T15:23:36.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I think from the responses there is a question about what \"poor\" colour contrast is, though. Several people struggled when the contrast was too high, as well as too low.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
