			"date": "2023-08-31T15:39:29.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.me.uk/@agvbergin\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>agvbergin</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> oh! Is my astigmatism why dark mode usually feels like nails on a chalkboard in my eyes? I just figured it was a tism thing.</p>",
