			"date": "2023-08-31T15:59:28.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> as a rule nobody should declare out in a public forum they have any kind of disability or health problem. it will get scraped up by data miners and be used \"against\" the person both by advertisers, potential employers, and other predators. and data lasts forever and can be duplicated and shared infinitely behind the scenes. I appreciate your goal tho</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110985440553693746",
			"parentId": "110984915662339438",
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@hmig/110985438938223443",
			"author": {
				"name": "Heather Migliorisi",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@hmig",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/306/585/044/998/658/original/c8e92825ca3632aa.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T17:36:41.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@sarajw\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sarajw</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>THIS so much. I usually use dark mode + plus have the device contrast turned down so much I’m the only one that can see/read it (to prevent migraines).</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110985447228518014",
			"parentId": "110985440553693746",
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@hmig/110985447194862009",
			"author": {
				"name": "Heather Migliorisi",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@hmig",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/306/585/044/998/658/original/c8e92825ca3632aa.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T17:38:47.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@sarajw\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sarajw</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> - I don’t think we talk enough about the sweet spot/Goldilocks of color contrast…enough, but not too much.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110985919813366771",
			"parentId": "110985447228518014",
			"url": "https://yatil.social/@yatil/110985919755822134",
			"author": {
				"name": "Eric Eggert",
				"url": "https://yatil.social/@yatil",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/110/079/623/377/683/254/original/c3fbc6cf02b4fb89.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T19:38:58.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@hmig\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>hmig</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@sarajw\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sarajw</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Totally. Plus we finally need to get the user preferences in browsers and guidelines of how to best support high/low contrast preferences to developers. It looked imminent a few years ago and still hasn’t really happened.</p><p>Everyone pretends that more contrast is always better, but in reality it hardly ever is for anyone.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110985931335166347",
			"parentId": "110985919813366771",
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@sarajw/110985929529932047",
			"author": {
				"name": "Sara Joy :happy_pepper:",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@sarajw",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/297/809/026/408/317/original/97d986685a3ca9d3.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T19:41:27.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://yatil.social/@yatil\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>yatil</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@hmig\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>hmig</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> not wanting to be tooting my own horn - but I wrote a little about this stuff a while ago. Starting to think it'd make a nice little lightning talk... still feels pretty relevant anyway: <a href=\"https://sarajoy.dev/blog/a11y-aspects/#contrast-levels\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">sarajoy.dev/blog/a11y-aspects/</span><span class=\"invisible\">#contrast-levels</span></a></p><p>Edit: if you click the card instead of the link, you'll go to the top of the article. Open the ToC and find the Contrast Levels section, for the relevant part :)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110985978196723178",
			"parentId": "110985931335166347",
			"url": "https://yatil.social/@yatil/110985978139544121",
			"author": {
				"name": "Eric Eggert",
				"url": "https://yatil.social/@yatil",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/110/079/623/377/683/254/original/c3fbc6cf02b4fb89.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T19:53:49.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@sarajw\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sarajw</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@hmig\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>hmig</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Please do the own-horn-tooting! This is a great article! (Funny enough, I have seen a lot of people use “Windows High Contrast Mode” to actually specify low contrast colors in the past. I guess that is why they renamed it eventually.)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110986060346613860",
			"parentId": "110985978196723178",
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@sarajw/110986058819351516",
			"author": {
				"name": "Sara Joy :happy_pepper:",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@sarajw",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/297/809/026/408/317/original/97d986685a3ca9d3.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T20:14:20.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://yatil.social/@yatil\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>yatil</span></a></span><br>Thank you! And thanks for the repost to your link stream thing 🙏</p><p>The contrast bit could probably do with some more research and become an article/talk in its own right..</p><p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@hmig\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>hmig</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110986074561134470",
			"parentId": "110986060346613860",
			"url": "https://yatil.social/@yatil/110986074511569164",
			"author": {
				"name": "Eric Eggert",
				"url": "https://yatil.social/@yatil",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/110/079/623/377/683/254/original/c3fbc6cf02b4fb89.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T20:18:19.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@sarajw\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sarajw</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@hmig\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>hmig</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I think it could be a good thing to dig into! It’s a fascinating topic because the needs are very diverse. (That’s one reason why I find the discussion on what contrast algorithm is the best not too useful.)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110986081766458442",
			"parentId": "110986074561134470",
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@sarajw/110986081714270553",
			"author": {
				"name": "Sara Joy :happy_pepper:",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@sarajw",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/297/809/026/408/317/original/97d986685a3ca9d3.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-31T20:20:09.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://yatil.social/@yatil\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>yatil</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@hmig\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>hmig</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> agreed.</p><p>I would love it if eventually on my company's website I could bring about essentially 4 modes, high contrast light, high contrast dark, lower contrast light, lower contrast dark. The thing is so complex though it'd be a huge challenge. Way easier to implement the two little toggles on my own site.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110986158360036355",
			"parentId": "110986081766458442",
